Zeitfokus
=========

Zeitfokus is based on the original Traggo server project:
https://github.com/traggo/server

This repository contains modifications and additional functionality, including
the Zeitfokus web interface, bilingual help, reporting, and optional local AI
analysis. The project remains licensed under the GNU General Public License,
version 3, as provided in LICENSE.

